---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Us | Toolbox Image" description="Why Toolbox Image builds private, browser-based image tools that keep your files on your device." path="/about" lang="en" altLang={null}>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</span>
      <h1>About Toolbox Image</h1>
      <p class="lede">Private, browser-based image tools that keep your files on your device.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>Toolbox Image started with a simple need: blur a face, name, screenshot, or background before sharing a photo, without uploading the original file to a remote server.</p>
      <p>Most of our tools run directly in your browser, so everyday editing tasks stay fast, private, and easy to use on desktop or mobile.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>What We Stand For</h2>
      <p>We believe useful image tools should be accessible, transparent, and respectful. Core browser-based tools are free to use and designed around local processing whenever possible.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>What We Are Building</h2>
      <p>We are growing Toolbox Image into a practical privacy-first toolkit with blur, compression, grain, video frame extraction, and browser-based AI restoration.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <div class="about-contact">
        <div class="info-card">
          <span class="info-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p class="info-main"><a href="mailto:yangkunming2026@gmail.com">yangkunming2026@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p class="info-sub">For feedback, bug reports, and privacy questions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <span class="info-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Location</h3>
          <p class="info-main">Singapore</p>
          <p class="info-sub">Serving users worldwide with browser-based tools.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <span class="info-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Support</h3>
          <p class="info-main">Within 24 hours</p>
          <p class="info-sub">Usually on business days for support requests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
